sage-fork

This project is a fork of SageAttention, scoped to sm89 (Ada / RTX 4090)
kernel optimization for ComfyUI consumer workloads. It is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE), consistent with the
licensing of the upstream projects it derives from.

================================================================================

This software incorporates and derives from the following third-party
projects. Their original copyright and Apache-2.0 license headers are
preserved in the individual source files.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SageAttention
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2024 by SageAttention team.
License: Apache-2.0
Website: https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention

The attention CUDA kernels (csrc/qattn/), the fused quantization kernels
(csrc/fused/), and the Triton quantization + attention kernels
(sageattention/triton/) are derived from SageAttention. This fork reaches
SageAttention by way of woct0rdho's fork
(https://github.com/woct0rdho/SageAttention), which carried the source
build / sm89 packaging work this fork builds on. The fork has diverged
substantially since (general-mask CUDA path, fp8 fused MLP, fused RoPE,
ComfyUI fp8 storage shims) and is no longer a thin patch on either parent.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FlashInfer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright (c) 2023 by FlashInfer team.
License: Apache-2.0
Website: https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer

Several low-level CUDA primitives that SageAttention (and therefore this
fork) builds on are adapted from FlashInfer v0.1.5 -- notably the MMA
wrappers (csrc/mma.cuh), the cp.async helpers (csrc/cp_async.cuh), the
permuted shared-memory layout (csrc/permuted_smem.cuh), and related
utility headers. Each such file retains the FlashInfer copyright notice
alongside the SageAttention modification notice.

